    "title": "'Heartbroken': Tallahassee restaurant owner hosts fundraiser for Venezuela earthquake relief - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brianna Shaw ,\n8 hours ago TALLAHASSEE, Fla. (WCTV) - A Tallahassee restaurant owner is turning her passion for Venezuelan culture into a mission to help families in her home country following recent earthquakes. Lida Yajure, co-owner of VeneBites, grew up in Venezuela before moving to the United States at 17. Years later, she opened VeneBites... Read full article",
